<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras maintained as buy. [CORRECTED 17:53 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras maintained as buy. [CORRECTED 17:53 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fator Securities said it was maintaining its buy recommendation on Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telebras.</p>
<p>-- It said Telebras' reported nine-month earnings was in line with Fator's expectations. Telebras had a net consolidated profit of 1.980 billion reais between January and September.</p>
<p>-- Fator Securities also said it was cutting slightly its earnings forecasts for 1996 to 2.665 billion reais from 2.870 billion reais.</p>
<p>(Corrects figures, which were reversed).</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
</text>
